  "title": "Delhi CNG Prices Rise Amid Fuel Crisis",
  "summary": "IGL raised CNG prices by Rs 3.89 per kg in Delhi, citing higher imported spot LNG prices after a West Asia conflict. The price surge has led to increased demand for fuel and calls for immediate fare hikes from local transport authorities.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "IGL raised CNG prices by Rs 3.89 per kg in Delhi from August 29, 2023, citing higher imported spot LNG prices.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "CNG prices in Delhi and adjoining cities increased by Rs 3.89 per kg from Saturday, according to Indraprastha Gas Ltd.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Local transport authorities in Delhi demanded an immediate fare hike, threatening a strike if the price increase was not met.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
